        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Subtract the discounted sale price from the original price to find the money saved, divide that savings by the original price, and multiply by 100 (e.g. ($25 saved ÷ $100 original) × 100 = 25% discount).
        </p>
